{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">; Punctuation</span>\n","class":"manual","created":2879,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310410","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/Punctuation_3.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/Punctuation_3.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"Punctuation_3\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">; Punctuation</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">In Progress<sup class=\"ph sup\">®</sup> Version 6.0 or later, the ANSI\nSQL (<code class=\"ph codeph\">-Q</code>) startup parameter allows you to redefine\nthe semicolon as a terminator. This startup parameter enforces strict\nANSI SQL conformance and allows you to terminate SQL statements\nwith a semicolon. The ANSI SQL (<code class=\"ph codeph\">-Q</code>) parameter allows OpenEdge<sup class=\"ph sup\">®</sup> to\nrun standard SQL statements and scripts built with other products. </p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The\nANSI SQL (<code class=\"ph codeph\">-Q</code>) parameter disables the use of the semicolon\nwithin UNIX escapes.</p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"Punctuation_3__idGDE1T72661380\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>UNIX SMBL=foo; export SMBL</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <p class=\"p\">As a general rule, use the period (.) as a terminator\nfor ABL statements even when you specify the ANSI SQL (<code class=\"ph codeph\">-Q</code>)\nparameter for an ABL session.</p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Punctuation_2.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Punctuation_2.html\">. Punctuation</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Punctuation_4.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Punctuation_4.html\">, Punctuation</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310410","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":2879,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"; Punctuation","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Punctuation_3.html","type":"Manual"}